# Arguments for `audiolink pi` at boot (see `python3 audiolink.pyz pi --help`).
# Ports are normally declared by the host (`audiolink host --expose PIPORT:PORT`);
# add `--forward LPORT:PORT` here for static forwards. The relay and --expose-setup
# come from the card's settings.txt (pi/card-settings.sh), which win over these.
--stats 30
